  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Scorpion is a pistol that fires sticky explosive rounds that attach to their target before detonating a moment after impact. Enemies who survive the initial hit are forced to choose between standing still while the charge detonates or moving to let it blow - neither is a good option. The blast radius and concussive force makes it particularly effective against clustered infantry who can't scatter before the detonation chain catches them all.</p>"
